Key results:
- Timeout-only pre-sleep sync: 10 s TCP probe, then progress-first full sync and headless auto-download batch; manual sleep unchanged; all code gated by `CROSSPOINT_KOBO_SYNC`.
- Added `KoboSyncService::runFullSync(...)`, host-tested probe/policy helpers, cancellation on button/Wi-Fi drop, and reader/shelf memory release before TLS.
- `pio run -e default` / `picco` / `slim` all SUCCESS; slim has 0 Kobo symbols; host tests 952/952 pass (baseline 943 + 9 new).
- No git commit or push performed.
